        {
          "source": "RGP",
          "paragraph": 85,
          "text": "The pentagonal carrier recursion has depth 3 (Theorem 1.1). The TRIAD has three irreducible modalities: □G (genealogical), □S (structural), □F (functional). These cardinalities are identical."
